{"updated":"2026-09-08T06:41:54.013Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Australian politics live: One Nation denies journalists access to press conference in Melbourne. Elsewhere, social media users could opt out of the algorithm if Australian government has its way – but that’s a big if. And palestine weekly: Israeli ministers push for depopulation of Gaza. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Israel, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.2 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 1.2 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 0.3 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 28 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.3 near 51 km NNE of Ruteng, Indonesia. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.17,0.22,0.27,0.34,0.42,0.46,0.51,0.56,0.6,0.63,0.66,0.7,0.72,0.78,0.91,1,1.17,1.42,1.53,1.58,1.61,1.64,1.68,1.71,1.73,1.75,1.8,1.85,1.92,1.97,2.02,2.06,2.09,2.14,2.17,2.19,2.25,2.3,2.33,2.37,2.42,2.46,2.51,2.57,2.61,2.67,2.74,2.81,2.93,3.02,3.19,3.22,3.26,3.3,3.35,3.4,3.47,3.59,3.67,3.73,3.8,3.84,3.9,3.94,3.98,4.03,4.05,4.08,4.12,4.14,4.17,4.19,4.24,4.28,4.37,4.42,4.49,4.57,4.63,4.75,4.79,4.85,4.88,4.93,5.05,5.2,5.38,5.89,5.98,6.05,6.08,6.14,6.2,6.27,6.34,6.41,6.46,6.49,6.55,6.59,6.66,6.73,6.79,6.84,6.92,6.99,7.04,7.12,7.19,7.3,7.36,7.54,7.57,7.85,7.96,8.03,8.08,8.13,8.17,8.27,8.32,8.37,8.42,8.49,8.56,8.6,8.67,8.74,8.86,8.94,8.97,9.04,9.1,9.16,9.21,9.24,9.28,9.33,9.38,9.45,9.51,9.59,9.67,9.75,9.87,9.95,10.02,10.1,10.15,10.19,10.24,10.28,10.31,10.38,10.43,10.47,10.52,10.56,10.6,10.66,10.69,10.74,10.81,10.87,10.9,10.94,10.97,11.02,11.05,11.09,11.13,11.17,11.21,11.27,11.31,11.39,11.46,11.52,11.56,11.59,11.62,11.66,11.77,11.89,12.27,12.39,12.45,12.5,12.55,12.6,12.64,12.69,12.75,12.